{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T17:53:02.884Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"dec610b5c29dc08047ecfcc1","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1726","claim:pm-gh1727","claim:pm-gh1728","claim:pm-gh1729","lineage:pm-gh1729","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1726+pm-gh1727+pm-gh1728+pm-gh1729","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1726","claim:pm-gh1727","claim:pm-gh1728","claim:pm-gh1729","lineage:pm-gh1729","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-14T17:53:02.880Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Codex review round 1 (gpt-6.1-sol xhigh, head 0f221bf98), two P2 findings, both verified and fixed: (1) an extension that extends or overrides a native command (registerFlags('list', ...) plus a list handler) had the native options (all, status) refused for direct callers, because the normalizer saw only contributed flags while CLI dispatch validates contributed and native definitions together. Fix: normalizeDirectExtensionCommandOptions takes nativeDefinitions; the harness and PmClient.run pass resolveNativeCommandOptionDefinitions(commandPath) (new src/sdk/extension/native-command-options.ts, kept out of command-options.ts so the sdk/authoring entrypoint does not load the flag-contract tables); an extension-created path resolves to the shared global flags only. (2) harness read-output admission judged the raw handler result while native formatOutput applies a registered command-result override first; admission now runs on the override's result and skips a suppressed-host-output result (tests/unit/sdk/extension/harness-parity.spec.ts covers both directions)."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T17:53:02.884Z"}],"before_hash":"4189811960348f9da51f6b70dff30f1b72d541f621a7e0dd711371dbab5f66dc","after_hash":"d49c4c0602a3982fa35f288c4678ab6a413e26447d1b32acb81bbccccce2b46c","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"c4a6589e0f2f8e288f1b64cab737a27a4a89a4c798ff80a8218abf26506770a3"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T18:16:16.017Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"dec610b5c29dc08047ecfcc1","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1726","claim:pm-gh1727","claim:pm-gh1728","claim:pm-gh1729","lineage:pm-gh1729","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1726+pm-gh1727+pm-gh1728+pm-gh1729","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1726","claim:pm-gh1727","claim:pm-gh1728","claim:pm-gh1729","lineage:pm-gh1729","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-14T18:16:16.016Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Codex review round 2 (head 51f6bd6cd), three P2 findings, all verified and fixed: (1) native aliases (--tags for --tag) and the positive key a --no-* flag sets (truncate from --no-truncate) were still refused for an extension that extends list; resolveNativeCommandOptionDefinitions now admits the canonical flag with its short letter, every alias, and the positive key of each --no-* flag, values untouched. (2) harness read-output admission ignored a structured output_format replacement that native formatEffectiveOutput admits in place of the result; the activation now attaches its service registry to the command registry (symbol pm.sdk.testing.activatedServices) and admission runs output_format first: a structured replacement is admitted, a string rendering leaves the result itself to be admitted. (3) an inline declaration (--from-tracker <path>) leaked its placeholder into flag, recovery.missing and the example (--from-tracker <path> <value>); formatLooseOptionLabel now labels a declaration by resolveExtensionLongFlagName, and the missing-option usage is built from the declared value contract (<path>, [kind] or none). Specs in tests/unit/sdk/extension/harness-parity.spec.ts."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T18:16:16.017Z"}],"before_hash":"d49c4c0602a3982fa35f288c4678ab6a413e26447d1b32acb81bbccccce2b46c","after_hash":"377737b8c94e712fb11a774859a2a301c79a348068a8aa422ff4f5c633119f8a","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"758d5d8b92fa668bdd4466cf458acf678669fb193cb72a11f568e7d17c3f6305"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T18:49:23.147Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"dec610b5c29dc08047ecfcc1","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1726","claim:pm-gh1727","claim:pm-gh1728","claim:pm-gh1729","lineage:pm-gh1729","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1726+pm-gh1727+pm-gh1728+pm-gh1729","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1726","claim:pm-gh1727","claim:pm-gh1728","claim:pm-gh1729","lineage:pm-gh1729","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-14T18:49:23.140Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Codex review round 3 (head 72046c9d4), four P2 findings, all verified and fixed: (1) runtime-schema flags (a workspace --story-points on list) were still refused on a native path an extension extends, which showed that enumerating every key a native command accepts (aliases, negations, settings-dependent runtime fields) is open-ended. Decision: the unknown-key refusal applies to extension-created command paths only; on a native path (hasSubcommandFlagContractsForCommand) undeclared keys keep passing through exactly as before, because the native contract owns them. normalizeDirectExtensionCommandOptions takes a DirectExtensionOptionPolicy ({ undeclaredKeys: 'refuse' | 'pass' }) and the harness and PmClient.run pass resolveDirectExtensionOptionPolicy(commandPath); the round-1/2 native-spelling enumeration is removed. GH-1727 is about extension commands, so its acceptance criteria are unaffected. (2) a raw repeatable declaration passed straight to the exported normalizer (no loader) was read as single-value; repeatable now counts as list at entry. (3) the harness ran output_format with the JSON branch even when the caller passed outputFormat: 'toon'; the format now comes from resolveReadOutputEncoding first. (4) the SDK surface snapshot is regenerated with an acknowledgement for the optional trailing policy argument, and DirectExtensionOptionPolicy is exported from ./sdk and ./sdk/authoring."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T18:49:23.147Z"}],"before_hash":"377737b8c94e712fb11a774859a2a301c79a348068a8aa422ff4f5c633119f8a","after_hash":"43c133673a351e60861012103d1bd4ad74e3d19ac2b164650fb35a4b0bedbeb8","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"b554e73037fe7ccf7d65ec5d94715a094bdd8309cb99d44ce934c00a5bf97def"}
